{"version":"2.0","class":"dataset","label":"03777: Persons in the labour force (LFS), by age, sex, contents and quarter","source":"Statistics Norway","updated":"2026-08-13T06:00:00Z","note":["There was a restructuring of the LFS from January 2006, where the age limit was lowered from 16 to 15 years. See [About the statistics](https://www.ssb.no/en/aku) for more information.\n\n","From 2018, a new estimation methodwas introduced, and the figures was revised back to 2006. For more information, see separate [article](https://www.ssb.no/arbeid-og-lonn/artikler-og-publikasjoner/new-estimation-methodology-for-the-norwegian-labour-force-survey).","A major restructuring of the LFS was carried out from January 2021, see [About the statistics](https://www.ssb.no/en/aku) for more information. Consequently, the number of persons aged 15-74 was reduced by 26 700 in the new LFS. The restructuring also led to a break in the number of employed persons calculated to 21 900 and a break in the number of unemployed persons calculated to 5 400 (both estimates, the last one not significant). The number of persons outside the labour force was redused by 54 000. The use of proxy interviewing ceased in 2021. This change seem to have given a break in some variables among young people."],"role":{"time":["Tid"],"metric":["ContentsCode"]},"id":["Alder","Kjonn","ContentsCode","Tid"],"size":[1,1,1,218],"dimension":{"Alder":{"label":"age","category":{"index":{"15-74":0},"label":{"15-74":"15-74 years"}},"extension":{"elimination":true,"eliminationValueCode":"15-74","show":"value"}},"Kjonn":{"label":"sex","category":{"index":{"0":0},"label":{"0":"Both sexes"}},"extension":{"elimination":true,"eliminationValueCode":"0","show":"value"},"link":{"describedby":[{"extension":{"Kjonn":"urn:ssb:classification:klass:2"}}]}},"ContentsCode":{"label":"contents","category":{"index":{"Personer":0},"label":{"Personer":"Persons in the labour force (1 000 persons)"},"unit":{"Personer":{"base":"1000 persons","decimal